{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "english", "appid": 924970, "month": "2025-10", "window": 1, "start_date": 1759276800, "end_date": 1759967999, "month_true_total": 251, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 20:54:03 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "206219240", "author": {"steamid": "76561198432977852", "personaname": "beanfruit", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/beanfruit/", "num_games_owned": 122, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 110, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 110, "last_played": 1730874790, "avatar": "eed30ce3e4062f8cb9472840b6d66650d5e6d749"}, "language": "english", "review": "goo goo gaa gaa", "timestamp_created": 1759958433, "timestamp_updated": 1759958433, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "206200397", "author": {"steamid": "76561198032586297", "personaname": "Rompus Cat", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Rompus_Cat/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 21119, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 71, "playtime_at_review": 18919, "last_played": 1787786385, "avatar": "94ea39163413f15a04237b0f933089247bd3c2f1"}, "language": "english", "review": "Launch & Updates\r\nIt started off rough—balance issues and uneven gameplay—but credit to the devs: they’ve done a great job improving things over time. Now it feels like the game it was meant to be.\r\n\r\nGameplay & Deck Building\r\nThe card-based skill decks are one of my favorite parts. Building and tweaking them adds a layer of strategy that keeps runs interesting and makes you want to experiment with different builds.\r\n\r\nLevel Design\r\nThe level designs are a strong point. Each area has just enough variety and challenge to keep the tension high while still being fun to revisit.\r\n\r\nOverall\r\nAt its best, Back 4 Blood is a fast-paced, chaotic co-op shooter that keeps me coming back. It’s not perfect, but it’s found its footing and offers plenty of replay value with friends.", "timestamp_created": 1759939826, "timestamp_updated": 1759939826, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.501699209213256836", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "206168060", "author": {"steamid": "76561199356956934", "personaname": "EvilNeoSega", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199356956934/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 828, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 375, "last_played": 1760815227, "avatar": "3604ac34b47c87e187d151f22aa17e107253ce34"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game.", "timestamp_created": 1759899838, "timestamp_updated": 1759899838, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "206158999", "author": {"steamid": "76561197983403880", "personaname": "Miller Time", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/kilo24/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 50, "playtime_forever": 10232, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6660, "last_played": 1785598843, "avatar": "7e790d3225bc3cdf2feadac8e22ff7f93b6cd912"}, "language": "english", "review": "A enjoyable mission/round based coop zombie shooter which has not had any new content or updates in a few years, but still has a reasonable amount of content. \nThere are also lots of random modifiers and variations to make the campaigns replayable. The build your skills/loadout with card unlocks system is great, even if at higher difficulty levels there is less player agency as you have to use one of the couple of handful of viable builds if you don't want to suffer. \nStill plenty enjoyable for a hundred hours, especially if you get it on sale. \nAnd yeah, unless you are wearing your thick rose tinted nostalgia glasses it's far better than Left 4 Dead 2.", "timestamp_created": 1759887138, "timestamp_updated": 1759887138, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "206149387", "author": {"steamid": "76561198045690906", "personaname": "Flyingeagle", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Flyingeagle3/", "num_games_owned": 483, "num_reviews": 90, "playtime_forever": 938, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 572, "last_played": 1770158593, "avatar": "02fc07e816006cfedede9826e3116482715cf05d"}, "language": "english", "review": "8/10", "timestamp_created": 1759874826, "timestamp_updated": 1759874826, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}]}